+## Google Play
+
+Two Android flavors: `sideload` (default, GitHub APK, in-app updater, `REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES` from `src/sideload`) and `play` (AAB, `kPlayBuild` true, permission stripped in `src/play`). Play forbids self-updating APKs - never let the play flavor reach `Updater`. Checklist and listing copy: [docs/PLAY_STORE.md](docs/PLAY_STORE.md).
+
